From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:49:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 22/34] Show a hint if HbbTV is available

Like a TV, show a hint after a channel switch if the channel signals
an HbbTV autostart application, as soon as no other OSD is open. Adds
a setup page to enable it and to set duration and position.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
